    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31538" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσφθείρομαι</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εφθάρην <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make entry to one's undoing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν βασιλείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.26.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.158
			</span></i>, Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσέρρησεν</span>
			; as an  abusive term, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ
				εἰσφθερεῖσθε θᾶττον.. ἐκποδών</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				276
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾶττον εἰσφθάρηθι σύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sam.</u>
					229
				</span></i>
			.</div>
